WEBVTT

00:05:27.554 --> 00:05:30.632
If you want to stay with branded,
please return the letter.'"

00:05:30.656 --> 00:05:31.810
(Laughter)

00:05:31.834 --> 00:05:33.045
Right?

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:34.837
What do you think happened?

00:05:36.841 --> 00:05:38.389
Lawyers, lawyers happened.

00:05:38.413 --> 00:05:41.742
(Laughter)

00:05:44.017 --> 00:05:45.862
It turns out, this is illegal.

00:05:45.886 --> 00:05:49.284
(Laughter)

00:05:51.398 --> 00:05:54.346
By the way, for brainstorming
and creativity,

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.924
doing things that are illegal
and immoral, it's fine,

00:05:56.948 --> 00:06:00.398
as long as it's just
in the brainstorming phase.